The skills in this directory are copied from
https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack/skills
(commit 799151d, pstack 0.14.4), except verify-aqualung, which is this
repository's project verification skill.

Included from pstack:
- principle-* (21 skills)
- unslop, tdd, technical-writing
- create-verification-skill, maintain-verification-skill
- how, why, blast-radius, no-comments, teach, bro
- architect, arena, swarm, interrogate, figure-it-out,
  show-me-your-work, recall

create-verification-skill and maintain-verification-skill write and look up
project verification skills under .agents/skills/verify-<app>/ instead of
.cursor/skills/verify-<app>/.

how, why, blast-radius, no-comments, teach, architect, arena, swarm,
interrogate, figure-it-out, show-me-your-work, and recall follow host.md:
no model slugs, workers optional, verify-aqualung for this repo. why
searches git and gh first and names gaps for sources it cannot reach.
no-comments inlines Comment Sicko instead of a plugin subagent. teach
runs how and why, then explains at the person's pace. bro restates the
last message in plain language. recall uses git/gh; chat logs are
optional.

verify-aqualung lives at .agents/skills/verify-aqualung/.

